cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this library, please cite it as below."
title: "MarkovProcess: sub-Markov kernel semigroups and continuous-path Markov processes in Lean 4"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 / mathlib library of sub-Markov transition semigroups, Feller
  semigroups, and the continuous-path Markov processes they generate: existence and
  uniqueness of the process for every starting point, the Markov and strong Markov
  properties, generators and Dynkin's formula, optional stopping and exit times, the
  killed process, equivariance, and processes in a measurable random environment. The
  development contains no sorry and no custom axiom.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Armstrong
    given-names: Scott
keywords:
  - Lean
  - mathlib
  - formal verification
  - Markov processes
  - Feller semigroups
  - strong Markov property
  - stochastic processes
license: Apache-2.0
# Add a Zenodo DOI here once an archived release is minted.
repository-code: "https://github.com/scottnarmstrong/MarkovProcess"
